<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 5TH DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 5TH DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the end of the</p>
<p>fifth and final day of the third cricket test between New</p>
<p>Zealand and England at Lancaster Park on Tuesday.</p>
<p>New Zealand</p>
<p>First innings 346</p>
<p>Second innings 186</p>
<p>England</p>
<p>First innings 228</p>
<p>Second innings (118 for two wickets overnight)</p>
<p>    N. Knight c Davis b Vettori		 29</p>
<p>    M. Atherton c Parore b Astle	     118</p>
<p>    A. Stewart c Pocock b Vettori	     17</p>
<p>    A. Caddick c Fleming b Doull		15</p>
<p>    N. Hussain c Fleming b Vettori	    33</p>
<p>    G. Thorpe c and b Vettori		    2</p>
<p>    J. Crawley not out			    40</p>
<p>    D. Cork not out				 39</p>
<p>    Extras (lb-8, nb-3, w-1, b-2)	     14</p>
<p>    Total for six wickets			307</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-64, 2-116 3-146 4-226 5-226 6-231</p>
<p>Did not bat: R. Croft, D. Gough, P. Tufnell.</p>
<p>Bowling: Allott 13-2-0-32 (w-1), Davis 17-5-0-43 (nb-2,</p>
<p>Doull 21-8-1-57, Vettori 58-19-4-97, Cairns 10-1-0-22 (nb-1),</p>
<p>Astle 28-10-1-45.</p>
<p>Result: England won by four wickets and take the three-match</p>
<p>series 2-0.</p>
<p>Man of the match: Mike Atherton</p>
</text>
